 .io_dmemREn         (dmem_ren),\n        .io_dmemReady       (1'b1),\n        // Channel 0 — the only retirement channel. With nret=1 in\n        // checks_si.cfg, every rvfi_* signal here is sized for a single\n        // channel, so the core's `_0` ports connect directly without\n        // slicing. No `_1` ports exist on the core's IO under nret=1.\n        .io_rvfi_valid_0    (rvfi_valid),\n        .io_rvfi_order_0    (rvfi_order),\n        .io_rvfi_insn_0     (rvfi_insn),\n\n…[7029 of 10101 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:4e19e7259ebfbfb4]…\n4 riscv32-unknown-elf-ranlib -> /opt/hwe-toolchain/xpack-riscv-none-elf-gcc-15.2.0-1/bin/riscv-none-elf-ranlib\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 nobody nogroup 79 Sep 28 02:44 riscv32-unknown-elf-readelf -> /opt/hwe-toolchain/xpack-riscv-none-elf-gcc-15.2.0-1/bin/riscv-none-elf-readelf\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 nobody nogroup 76 Sep 28 02:44 riscv32-unknown-elf-size -> /opt/hwe-toolchain/xpack-riscv-none-elf-gcc-15.2.0-1/bin/riscv-none-elf-size\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 nobody nogroup 79 Sep 28 02:44 riscv32-unknown-elf-strings -> /opt/hwe-toolchain/xpack-riscv-none-elf-gcc-15.2.0-1/bin/riscv-none-elf-strings\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 nobody nogroup 77 Sep 28 02:44 riscv32-unknown-elf-strip -> /opt/hwe-toolchain/xpack-riscv-none-elf-gcc-15.2.0-1/bin/riscv-none-elf-strip\n.gitignore:87:cores/*/implementation_notes.md\ntools/sandbox.py:100:    if path in _KEEP_IGNORED or path == \"implementation_notes.md\":\ntools/sandbox.py:102:    if target and path == f\"cores/{target}/implementation_notes.md\":\ntools/tournament.py:444:        'implementation_notes': _read_notes(worktree),\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
