{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"agent_message","text":"The larger replay store saves more cycles when it stays active after a predicted taken transfer. Gowin has also exposed a longer fetch path in several variants, so I’m testing whether simpler lookup and recovery logic can retain those cycle savings at the target clock."}}
